  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation- Rapid Groundwater Resource Mapping for Integrated Water Resource Management in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Royal Danish Embassy in Addis Ababa (RDE) is preparing a new water programme for Ethiopia: Global Green Transition Water programme in Ethiopia (2024-2028) to support the linkages between climate, water and the Strategic Sector Cooperation between Denmark and Ethiopia, alongside with the broader water portfolio of the Embassy in the country. The RDE is commissioning a formulation study to guide and develop this new water and climate programme.</narrative>
  </description>
